### Variabel Lingkungan
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@authToken = {{login.response.body.token}}
@walletId = {{createWallet.response.body.wallet.id}}
@pocketId = {{createPocket.response.body.pocket.id}}
@categoryId = {{createCategory.response.body.category.id}}

### 1. Health Check Server & Database
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### AUTHENTICATION FLOW
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Register Akun Baru
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Santoso",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "PasswordRahasia123!"
}

### 3. Verifikasi Email OTP
# Catatan: Ambil kode 6 digit yang tercetak di terminal backend Anda!
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "code": "217293"
}

### 4. Login (Menghasilkan JWT Token otomatis ke variabel @authToken)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "PasswordRahasia123!"
}

### 5. Cek Profil User
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### WALLETS & POCKETS FLOW
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 6. Buat Dompet Kas Utama (Rekening Bank BCA)
# @name createWallet
POST {{baseUrl}}/finance/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bank BCA",
  "balance": 10000000
}

### 7. Ambil Semua Dompet
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Buat Pos Tabungan Berencana (Beli Laptop)
# @name createPocket
POST {{baseUrl}}/pockets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Beli Laptop Kerja",
  "targetAmount": 15000000,
  "isEmergency": false
}

### 9. Ambil Semua Pockets (Dana Darurat & Tabungan dengan Progress %)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pockets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### CATEGORIES FLOW
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 10. Buat Kategori Pengeluaran (Makan & Minum)
# @name createCategory
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Makan & Minum",
  "type": "EXPENSE"
}

### 11. Ambil Semua Kategori
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### TRANSAKSI & MUTASI SALDO FLOW (ACID)
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 12. Transaksi Pengeluaran (Makan Siang)
# Saldo di dompet BCA otomatis berkurang Rp 50.000
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "EXPENSE",
  "amount": 50000,
  "description": "Makan siang nasi padang",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}"
}

### 13. Alokasi Tabungan (Kirim Kas ke Pos Beli Laptop)
# Saldo BCA berkurang Rp 1.000.000, Saldo Tabungan Laptop bertambah Rp 1.000.000
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "SAVING_DEPOSIT",
  "amount": 1000000,
  "description": "Nabung gaji bulan ini",
  "walletId": "{{walletId}}",
  "pocketId": "{{pocketId}}"
}

### 14. Ambil Riwayat Transaksi (Pagination & Detail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### DASHBOARD OVERVIEW & ANALYTICS
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 15. Overview Dashboard (Total Liquid Cash, Dana Darurat, & Net Worth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/finance/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 16. Analisis Pengeluaran & Breakdown Kategori
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/analytics
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### SECURITY & ACCOUNT MANAGEMENT FLOW
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 17. Request OTP Ganti Password
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password/request-otp
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 18. Forgot Password Request (Link Reset via Email)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password/request
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "budi@example.com"
}